$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-not-found
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-hub-page mgdb-not-found-page" id="not-found-top">

  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><span aria-current="page">Page not found</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="mgdb-hero not-found-hero" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <div class="mgdb-hero-emblem not-found-emblem">
      <img src="/images/404err.jpg" width="400" height="264" alt="" decoding="async" />
      <strong>404</strong>
      <span>Page not found</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <h1 id="not-found-title">That page is not here</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">Nothing at MaizeGDB answers to this address. It may have been retired, renamed during the site redesign, or simply mistyped.</p>
      <p class="not-found-path">You asked for <code>$(requested_path)</code></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this page">
    <a href="#not-found-next" class="is-current" aria-current="true">What to try</a>
    <a href="#not-found-hubs">Data hubs</a>
    <a href="#not-found-related">Related resources</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="not-found-next" aria-labelledby="not-found-next-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="not-found-next-title">What to try</h2></div>
    </div>

    <ol class="not-found-steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Search for it</h3>
        <p>The search box at the top of this page covers genes, loci, markers, stocks, references and everything else MaizeGDB curates. A gene symbol, a model accession or an author name is usually enough.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Check the address</h3>
        <p>Record pages need a full identifier &mdash; <code>Zm00001eb067740</code> rather than part of one &mdash; and identifiers are case-sensitive. A partial name is a search rather than a record.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Look it up in the site map</h3>
        <p>The <a href="/sitemap">site map</a> lists every page on MaizeGDB in one place, which is the quickest way to find something that has been renamed.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Tell us</h3>
        <p>If you followed a link from within MaizeGDB, that link is our mistake and we would like to fix it. Please report it through the <a href="/feedback">feedback form</a>, or write to the <a href="/contact">MaizeGDB team</a>.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="not-found-hubs" aria-labelledby="not-found-hubs-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="not-found-hubs-title">Data hubs</h2></div>
    </div>

    <p class="not-found-lead">Most of what MaizeGDB holds is reached through one of these.</p>

    <div class="mgdb-card-grid not-found-hub-grid">
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/gene_center/gene">
        <strong>Genes and gene models</strong>
        <span>Gene models from every assembly, with functional annotation, expression and pan-gene membership</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/data_center/locus">
        <strong>Loci</strong>
        <span>Classical genetic loci, their symbols, phenotypes and map positions</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/genome">
        <strong>Genomes</strong>
        <span>Assemblies and annotations for maize and its wild relatives</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/data_center/stock">
        <strong>Stocks</strong>
        <span>Genetic stocks and germplasm, and how to order them</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/data_center/reference">
        <strong>References</strong>
        <span>The maize literature curated at MaizeGDB</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgdb-card not-found-hub" href="/data_center">
        <strong>All data hubs</strong>
        <span>Maps, markers, variation, phenotypes, images, expression and the rest</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="not-found-related" class="mgdb-hub-related" aria-labelledby="not-found-related-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="not-found-related-title">Related resources</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel">
      <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
        <a href="/sitemap">
          <strong>Site map</strong>
          <span>Every page on MaizeGDB, grouped by what it is for</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/BLAST">
          <strong>BLAST</strong>
          <span>Search a sequence against maize assemblies, gene models and proteins</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/download">
          <strong>Downloads</strong>
          <span>Bulk data files for every assembly and annotation MaizeGDB hosts</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/feedback">
          <strong>Report a broken link</strong>
          <span>Tell us what you were looking for and where the link was</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact">
          <strong>Contact the MaizeGDB team</strong>
          <span>Questions about the data, the tools, or the site itself</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
)
